- [ ] At most configured executor concurrency is active and at most one integration is active.
- [ ] A dependent issue never starts from an unintegrated parent submission.
- [ ] Independent work continues after another issue exhausts attempts.
- [ ] Each candidate validates against the latest integration commit.
- [ ] Simultaneous fixture applications receive distinct ports/resources and owned cleanup releases them.
- [ ] This slice's behavioral regression tests pass: `bun test tests/integration/08-concurrency.test.ts`.
